Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.68,0:00:05.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the day we decided to depart,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.51,0:00:09.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we burned down our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.27,0:00:20.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.69,0:00:20.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:23.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leaving the village, I mean.\NYou don't have any regrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:25.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.07,0:00:28.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We decided to do this ourselves,\Nyou know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:31.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, I think you're the one\Nwho'll miss it more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.54,0:00:34.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm all excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.79,0:00:37.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm going to\Nbecome a State Alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.88,0:00:38.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.55,0:00:41.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.67,0:00:44.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get your body fixed, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.68,0:00:48.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all right. You just need to worry about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:53.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, how do we get to be State Alchemists?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.94,0:00:55.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of training does it take?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.98,0:01:03.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they performed human transmutation\Nand escaped with their lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.36,0:01:05.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then I am more interested in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.65,0:01:08.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They could make fine State Alchemists.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.58,0:01:13.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, we're going to go meet this Roy person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.21,0:01:18.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who knows? With talent as abundant as mine is,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.84,0:01:20.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it'll be a piece of cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.13,0:01:25.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you concerned about Winry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.22,0:01:34.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing we can do about it.\NIt's something those two have set their minds to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.10,0:01:37.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll be back\Nonce they grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.85,0:01:40.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed...\NAl...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.86,0:01:45.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:50.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.83,0:01:55.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.58,0:02:01.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.99,0:03:56.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, do you know which train we're supposed to transfer to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:59.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's coming at nine o'clock tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.70,0:04:01.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Until then, let's get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.87,0:04:03.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:05.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.21,0:04:10.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was a cinch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:14.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kids, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.09,0:04:15.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Off to bed with you now,\Nlike good boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:20.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.40,0:04:27.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't {\i1}you{\i0} give it a rest there, instead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.36,0:04:29.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nicely done!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.74,0:04:32.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.70,0:04:35.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was that strange power just now alchemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.87,0:04:36.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.41,0:04:41.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To think that boys your age could be alchemists!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.41,0:04:46.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In these parts, Majhal would have to be the only alchemist around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.88,0:04:48.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Majhal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.29,0:04:49.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.42,0:04:52.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's said that he has helped others out many times with his alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.80,0:04:54.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's quite well respected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.76,0:04:56.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.34,0:04:59.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, the next village over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:02.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you'd better not go there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:04.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's this ominous rumor going around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.02,0:05:07.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The rumor has it that dead people
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.61,0:05:10.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are coming back to life in that village and attacking the villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.78,0:05:16.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know about this Majhal person, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.95,0:05:21.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, but I saw that same name among all those letters of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.16,0:05:23.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean Dad's?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:26.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I remember, he wrote about human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.08,0:05:30.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it's the same person,\Nit couldn't hurt to meet him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:31.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.09,0:05:34.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This seems like\Nit's going to be a good trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:38.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure seem unusually happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.39,0:05:43.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, we did catch that purse-snatcher, and everyone congratulated us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.85,0:05:46.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how to say this,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.85,0:05:49.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I'm happy that our alchemy was able to help others out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:01.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.41,0:06:03.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.50,0:06:06.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That seat was hard and bounced around something awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.37,0:06:08.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You weren't bothered?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.33,0:06:09.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.05,0:06:12.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.67,0:06:15.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,those are some incredible decorations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.01,0:06:17.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there some festival going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.68,0:06:23.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yikes! That one went toward the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.81,0:06:25.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.18,0:06:26.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This place is off-limits!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.98,0:06:28.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of\Na fireworks rehearsal here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.06,0:06:31.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,F-Fireworks?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.52,0:06:32.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.15,0:06:35.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The fireworks for the festival, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.28,0:06:38.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never seen your faces before, have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.03,0:06:43.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's with this guy?\NHe's got a strange outfit on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:45.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.45,0:06:47.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's get 'em. Should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.01,0:07:01.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We got 'em!\NThey're weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.47,0:07:02.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.19,0:07:17.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you Majhal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.95,0:07:25.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.79,0:07:27.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An impressive spirit bonding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.96,0:07:30.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-He knows about me, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.87,0:07:33.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just what you'd expect of Hohenheim's sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.25,0:07:37.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, you've inherited his great talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:41.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then, what can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.55,0:07:46.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't very well turn down the \Nrequest of the sons of a dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.68,0:07:50.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We wanted to ask about the human transmutation you wrote about
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.94,0:07:52.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in the letter you sent him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.15,0:07:54.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Human transmutation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.73,0:07:58.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You do know that it is\Nforbidden by law, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:00.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.82,0:08:05.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I want to return \NAl's body back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.16,0:08:11.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The costs accompanying a human transmutation are altogether too great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.92,0:08:13.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know how you must feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.58,0:08:16.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but such an act is something that only God is allowed to perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.05,0:08:21.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why did you correspond with him \Nabout human transmutation?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.18,0:08:26.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Youthful enthusiasm...\NI guess you would call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.77,0:08:32.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Majhal-sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.77,0:08:37.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made some rose jam,\Nif you'd like some.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.27,0:08:40.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm always grateful, Lebi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.40,0:08:40.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.78,0:08:42.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.03,0:08:45.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was there something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.91,0:08:46.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.87,0:08:48.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.58,0:08:50.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay then, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.51,0:09:03.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to mention it, there's a festival happening soon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.72,0:09:06.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the Requiem Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:11.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The spirits of the dead are sent up\Non fireworks, to return them to Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.68,0:09:14.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've heard rumors about this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.85,0:09:17.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They say the dead are coming back to life\Nand attacking people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.86,0:09:19.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does that have anything to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.94,0:09:23.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's just a silly, baseless rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.95,0:09:29.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My, my, I'm certainly having a lot of visitors today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.74,0:09:31.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:33.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Clause!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.54,0:09:36.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Majhal-sama, I'm really sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.00,0:09:40.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to apologize?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.25,0:09:42.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's their own fault for being so weak, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.34,0:09:43.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For boys, anyhow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:46.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:46.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, control yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.34,0:09:50.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clause, I know that you're upset about your sister's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.14,0:09:53.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you were once\Nsuch a gentle little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.81,0:09:57.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What would your late sister think if she saw you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.90,0:09:58.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.11,0:10:01.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows how I feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:05.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My sister didn't just die—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:06.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she was killed when that lady came back to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.11,0:10:08.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Came back to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.24,0:10:12.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clause!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.46,0:10:18.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.02,0:10:39.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys are...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.77,0:10:41.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,alchemists?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.32,0:10:47.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been half a year\Nsince my sister died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.07,0:10:49.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We didn't know the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.11,0:10:51.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One of the villagers found her as they were passing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.03,0:10:54.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She looking like she was asleep, but she was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.29,0:10:57.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then, on the night of her funeral...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.17,0:11:07.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clause...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.81,0:11:20.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,K-Karin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.90,0:11:32.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad said that she was a woman who lived in this village a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.24,0:11:34.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.53,0:11:37.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The dead woman\Ncame back to life and killed my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.75,0:11:39.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And not only her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:42.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all because of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:47.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, if you're alchemists, then avenge her for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.84,0:11:51.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've asked Majhal-san, \Nbut he won't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.93,0:11:55.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's only natural that\NMajhal-san won't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.77,0:12:00.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's because your story is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.77,0:12:03.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm not too wild\Nabout taking any revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.90,0:12:05.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.73,0:12:07.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys are really just scared, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.19,0:12:09.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you call yourselves alchemists!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.82,0:12:12.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're just a pipsqueak and an armor fanatic!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.32,0:12:13.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pipsqueak?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.28,0:12:14.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Armor fanatic?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.74,0:12:16.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you call me a pipsqueak!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:18.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm still going to grow up ultra-big!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.87,0:12:20.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a pipsqueak now, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:22.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pipsqueak!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.75,0:12:24.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ultra-hyper-super-pipsqueak!\NShut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.29,0:12:27.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about you?! If you're a girl,\Nwhy don't you at least dress a little like one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.88,0:12:29.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,None of your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.72,0:12:39.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Karin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.27,0:12:42.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yes, she did live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.35,0:12:48.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She made a living by raising flowers,\Nand she was a beautiful woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.11,0:12:51.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It must be twenty years ago now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.03,0:12:56.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She succeeded in cultivating a very difficult blue rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:12:59.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her smile at the time was simply...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.79,0:13:01.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.50,0:13:07.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,while she was riding in a carriage,\Nshipping her blue roses to the city...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.22,0:13:16.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she fell down along the\Nmountain roads and died there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.84,0:13:19.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they say that this Karin-san is attacking the villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.47,0:13:21.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way that could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.06,0:13:24.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The dead do not come back to life, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.94,0:13:27.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And besides, even if she\Nwere to come back to life,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.69,0:13:30.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it's inconceivable that she would attack the other villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.99,0:13:34.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.95,0:13:37.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true, dead people\Ndon't come back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.66,0:13:41.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But supposing that someone were to perform a human transmutation...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.16,0:13:45.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only person in this village who would be capable of that is Majhal-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.26,0:13:54.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.13,0:13:55.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hear what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.51,0:14:00.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're really going to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.26,0:14:05.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're going to catch this \NKarin zombie with our own hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:08.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, are you afraid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.31,0:14:11.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone else will probably get killed if this keeps up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.86,0:14:12.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.19,0:14:17.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what are you doing, old lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.11,0:14:19.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:21.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I don't need your money, just go, would you? \NYou can't just stay here all day
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.95,0:14:23.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, we make our \Nmove tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.95,0:14:23.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.95,0:14:23.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}over one bowl of soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.91,0:14:28.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:29.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.04,0:14:31.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.50,0:14:32.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.96,0:14:34.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:37.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There aren't really any zombies around, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.01,0:14:39.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.18,0:14:42.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the rumors are true, then it could only be by human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.06,0:14:44.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's worth checking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.85,0:14:48.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.77,0:14:49.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We caught her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.94,0:14:55.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're hurting me, Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:15:00.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.45,0:15:01.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.96,0:15:15.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0}... took my sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:16.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clause!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.44,0:15:37.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That sound...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.36,0:15:42.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The alchemist Majhal...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.99,0:15:44.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Second-rate after all, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.42,0:15:57.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's Majhal-sama for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.13,0:16:02.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Majhal-sama, I knew you would put down that zombie for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.27,0:16:09.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.02,0:16:13.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was neither a zombie\Nnor a human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.48,0:16:17.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was the same sound that I heard that other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.99,0:16:22.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Majhal-sama will be cross with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.57,0:16:25.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,wandering around his residence on your own like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.53,0:16:28.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.71,0:16:35.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.38,0:16:42.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.39,0:16:46.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.81,0:16:56.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.19,0:16:58.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, you're awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.28,0:17:03.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It appears that you've seen something that you shouldn't have seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:04.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.99,0:17:06.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The identity of that zombie, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.99,0:17:08.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is your doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.49,0:17:12.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, spirit bonding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.41,0:17:18.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I take a mannequin that is the perfect likeness of Karin and bond one of the village girls to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.09,0:17:22.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By doing so, they were supposed to resemble a living Karin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.47,0:17:24.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.05,0:17:29.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spirits do not tend to bond to vessels that are unlike them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.47,0:17:33.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may think they are bonded,\Nbut ordinarily, they are not functional.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.68,0:17:37.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There were even those who\Nslipped out of here on their own\Nand wandered around the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.44,0:17:41.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you realize what you've done?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.57,0:17:43.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would you do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.32,0:17:47.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Karin was the only woman I ever loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.03,0:17:52.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter how many years pass since Karin's death, my scars will not heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.75,0:17:55.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made up my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.92,0:17:59.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that I would bring Karin\Nback to life through alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.21,0:18:03.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, it was impossible for me to perform human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:07.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That being the case, I wanted to at least create something that was close to Karin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.55,0:18:10.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.81,0:18:12.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.10,0:18:14.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.60,0:18:17.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just love Karin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:19.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to assist me now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.73,0:18:23.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in a spiritual bonding for my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.82,0:18:24.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.07,0:18:28.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.82,0:18:30.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're just as stubborn as Hohenheim was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.54,0:18:37.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, I wanted to thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.87,0:18:39.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You foolish girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.67,0:18:40.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.38,0:18:44.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please stop, Majhal-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.21,0:18:45.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,End this already!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.63,0:18:46.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.55,0:18:47.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.01,0:18:52.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, do something, fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.64,0:18:56.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a little more...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:05.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A blue rose?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.65,0:19:13.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Receive this girl's spirit and smile \Nupon me this time without fail, Karin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.41,0:19:16.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.00,0:19:17.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.46,0:19:23.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop, Majhal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.92,0:19:26.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't understand a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.17,0:19:28.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What you were seeking\Nhas been right next to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.17,0:19:30.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.76,0:19:33.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Karin-san didn't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:37.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After the accident, she lost her memory and lived from then on someplace else!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.31,0:19:41.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then, twenty years later,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.31,0:19:44.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Karin-san got her memory back and came straight back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:47.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you didn't realize it was her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.03,0:19:54.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Majhal...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:59.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Impossible...\NAre you saying that this woman is Karin?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.66,0:20:02.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Karin was more beautiful than any other woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.42,0:20:04.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like a rose!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.04,0:20:06.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Face reality!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.30,0:20:08.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Flowers wither.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:12.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Karin-san's feelings \Ntoward you have not changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.01,0:20:16.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Silence! Say one more word, \Nand I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.71,0:20:51.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Majhal!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.80,0:20:53.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.97,0:20:57.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are not... Karin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.43,0:21:03.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way... you could be Karin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.13,0:21:32.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you moping about, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.09,0:21:39.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was thinking that alchemy can also delude people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.27,0:21:42.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.48,0:21:52.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.49,0:21:57.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.41,0:22:01.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really are terrific alchemists, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.79,0:22:05.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That may be so,\Nbut who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.66,0:22:06.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.71,0:22:07.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clause?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.05,0:22:15.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "Ehhh!"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.76,0:22:23.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You definitely look better in those clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.97,0:22:24.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.76,0:23:40.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.84,0:23:44.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 5: "Dash! Automail"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.47,0:23:46.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You wanted power too, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.81,0:23:51.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what the man with the mechanical arm said to me.
